{"title":"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 11","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> be a constant. The simultaneous equations\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/f/d/1fd34b6a4362fa7b3feb9289ff9f3810656b8f20.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*}x-y = &amp;\\ 2 \\\\cx+y = &amp;\\ 3 \\\\\\end{align*}\" width=\"83\" height=\"40\" />\nhave a solution <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/f/adfd9ae8a3fac031d3b8b470a52a709a23d4d6d2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x, y)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"44\" height=\"20\" /> inside Quadrant I if and only if\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/0/ea0aa2f06370c8eca6aae79899d66ad91a051acc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ c=-1 \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ c&gt;-1 \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ c&lt;\\frac{3}{2} \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ 0&lt;c&lt;\\frac{3}{2}\\\\ \\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ -1&lt;c&lt;\\frac{3}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"470\" height=\"75\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can easily solve the equations algebraically to deduce <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/3/843288e27a1b85fe7ccf8ec0874c7fa767da5063.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\frac{5}{c+1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"80\" height=\"40\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/c/ebcf43b40c25541c5df602d043f588f806c90149.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = \\frac{3-2c}{c+1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -14px\" width=\"84\" height=\"39\" />. Thus we firstly need <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/5/8d53b86b6761f1b5bb5dadd1a82f8580469f937b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x &gt; 0 \\implies c + 1 &gt; 0 \\implies c &gt; -1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"269\" height=\"14\" />. Now <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/6/2/f6267cf18ccdbddb223019a94263e5b80bafe617.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y &gt; 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"42\" height=\"16\" /> implies <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/7/e77b022970ba85a2d45c0d2162cd1e8cda986b71.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{3-2c}{c+1} &gt; 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -14px\" width=\"85\" height=\"39\" />, and since we now know that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/9/a398005d35072ae993a9ac8b72dd8e746fcc416e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"41\" height=\"15\" /> must be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/0/4/f040b184e0e6eaa9464f09c389a6f60fcf1f27c4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$&gt;0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"27\" height=\"13\" />, the inequality simply becomes <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/b/0/8b0ac157c2934c3f93b26b4a867d257423525f2c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3-2c &gt; 0 \\implies 3 &gt; 2c \\implies c &lt; \\frac{3}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"274\" height=\"37\" />. Thus we combine the inequalities <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/8/0f8502974f17e394687ea5eb088fa7709096b6b5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c &gt; -1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"54\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/f/faffc3efaee1a3a45191d20f1dbcdb1e78143415.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c &lt; \\frac{3}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"43\" height=\"37\" /> to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/8/c98562b4a297dc234292411d609cf4b13f71b3e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-1 &lt; c &lt; \\frac{3}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"91\" height=\"37\" />, which is answer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/3/d1302e73ece29d10218238af739577904f6f00a3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\text{E}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME\" title=\"1987 AHSME\">1987 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1987 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1987\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">Problem 10</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 12\">Problem 12</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17\" titl